  "prefLabel": "Phy 401.09 Direct supervision",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Phy 401.09 “Direct supervision” means “direct supervision” as defined in RSA 328-A:2, IV, namely, “that the physical therapist is physically present and immediately available for direction and supervision.”\n\nSource. #9456, eff 4-17-09; renumbered by #10061 (from Phy 401.06); ss by #12088, eff 1-20-17",
